        <param name="context">To be added.</param>
        <param name="chooserIntent">an <c>Intent#ACTION_CHOOSER</c> intent that will be used as a base
            for the new Chooser session.
            &lt;p&gt;An interactive Chooser session also supports the following chooser parameters:
            &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;<c>Intent#EXTRA_ALTERNATE_INTENTS</c>&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;<c>Intent#EXTRA_INITIAL_INTENTS</c>&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;<c>Intent#EXTRA_EXCLUDE_COMPONENTS</c>&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;<c>Intent#EXTRA_REPLACEMENT_EXTRAS</c>&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;<c>Intent#EXTRA_CHOOSER_TARGETS</c>&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;<c>Intent#EXTRA_CHOOSER_REFINEMENT_INTENT_SENDER</c>&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;<c>Intent#EXTRA_CHOOSER_RESULT_INTENT_SENDER</c>&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;<c>Intent#EXTRA_CHOSEN_COMPONENT_INTENT_SENDER</c>&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;/ul&gt;
            &lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;See also <c>Intent#createChooser(Intent, CharSequence) </c>.&lt;/p&gt;</param>
        <summary>Starts a new interactive Chooser session.</summary>
        <returns>To be added.</returns>
        <remarks>
          <para>Starts a new interactive Chooser session. The method is idempotent and will start Chooser
            only once.</para>
